---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description={`Who we are and what we believe at ${site.name}.`}>
  <PageHero
    title="About Us"
    lead="Impact Life Church is a Bible-believing home church, a small fellowship gathered around God’s Word and open to people from every background. We exist to give you a place to seek, grow, and serve, right around the table with people who know your name."
  />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container grid grid--2">
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Everything is about Jesus.</h3>
        <p>We want Him at the center of all we do, and our church is, and always must be, about Him.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Everything begins in the family.</h3>
        <p>That’s why we meet in homes, where real relationships grow and no one gets lost in a crowd.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--tint">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>Our Mission</h2>
      <p class="mission">To impact families with the Gospel and help them live out their faith to impact their world.</p>

      <h2>Our Vision</h2>
      <p>Impact Life Church desires to be a small fellowship completely surrendered to God’s will, living in the abundance He has for His children.</p>
      <p>That abundance isn’t the material things of this world. It’s the overflowing fruit of His Holy Spirit:</p>
      <blockquote>
        <p>“But the fruit of the Spirit is love, joy, peace, longsuffering, kindness, goodness, faithfulness, gentleness, self-control. Against such there is no law.”</p>
        <cite>Galatians 5:22-23, NKJV</cite>
      </blockquote>
      <p>It also means using the gifts He has given each of us to serve Him, and in a small group, everyone’s gifts are needed.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--dark">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>What to Expect</h2>
      <p>Here you are family, so expect a lot of love. Come as you are, in whatever style of dress, and we’ll offer you a warm welcome and a hand of friendship. We want you to become who God has called you to be, and we enjoy every flower in God’s garden of life.</p>
      <p>Our gatherings are relaxed and personal. Worship is contemporary, sometimes with different styles when guest musicians join us. The teaching is relevant and Bible-centered, challenging believers to live fully for God and inviting the weary soul to receive Christ as Lord and Savior. There’s time for conversation, questions, and prayer for one another. We like to have fun, and we celebrate the abundant life He has for us!</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .prose { max-width: 760px; }
  .prose h2:not(:first-child) { margin-top: 2.5rem; }
  .mission {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--olive-700);
  }
  blockquote {
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--olive-600);
    background: var(--white);
    border-radius: 0 var(--radius) var(--radius) 0;
    font-style: italic;
  }
  blockquote p { margin: 0 0 0.5rem; }
  cite { font-style: normal; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--muted); }
  cite::before { content: "— "; }
</style>
